# -------------------------------------------------------------
# Docker context allowlist (Ignore everything, allow build files)
# -------------------------------------------------------------

# 1. Ignore everything by default to keep build context minimal
*

# 2. Re-include directories
!*/

# 3. Re-include only what the Docker build requires
!go.mod
!go.sum
!*.go
!internal/**
!cmd/**
!pkg/**
!Dockerfile
!authorized_keys

# Never send local Git history or secrets into the build context
.git
.github
ssh/
*.pem
*.key
*.env
